1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
I live buried in voice notes,
screenshots, bills, and links.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,800
Hub is a living archive:
I dump chaos into Telegram.

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:14,500
An agent organizes it
and takes action for me.

4
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:20,000
And this is already live
on Google Cloud Run.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Look at the URL — a real
hosted app, not localhost.

6
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,500
First flow: money.
I send loose text,

7
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:38,000
the same way I would
send it on WhatsApp.

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:44,500
The agent extracts the amounts,
classifies income and expense,

9
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:50,000
and files everything
under Finance.

10
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,500
No spreadsheet.
No form to fill.

11
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:08,000
Watch the bot reply,
then the Finance view update.

12
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Income and spend land
as structured facts.

13
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Second flow: a commitment.
I ask it to remind me

14
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:31,500
to call a supplier
tomorrow at 2 p.m.

15
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:38,000
The agent does not only take a note —
it proposes a Google Calendar event.

16
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:44,500
I confirm in Telegram
with one tap.

17
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:52,000
Without my OK,
nothing is created.

18
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Human-in-the-loop:
propose first, confirm second.

19
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:18,000
Calendar gets the event
only after I approve.

20
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:25,000
On the dashboard I see
the whole living archive:

21
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:32,500
folders, links, workouts,
documents, and money.

22
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:39,000
The UI is in English
for the hackathon.

23
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:46,500
One tap switches back
to Portuguese.

24
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:55,000
Everything that arrived on Telegram
lands here, already classified.

25
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Cloud Run URL again —
proof it is hosted.

26
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:14,000
Hub: Telegram in,
ADK agent with Gemini on Vertex,

27
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:21,500
Firestore and Cloud Storage underneath,
Calendar and Gmail with confirmation.

28
00:03:21,500 --> 00:03:28,500
Taskmaster track —
All Things Agentic Hackathon.

29
00:03:28,500 --> 00:03:36,000
Chaos goes in.
Action comes out.

30
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:40,000
That is Hub.
